  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Azure Event Hubs — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for EventHubProducerClient and EventHubConsumerClient. Includes a built-in EventHubsTransientErrors predicate that leverages EventHubsException.IsTransient so retries are always safe and correct.",
